      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "携带了电气球的皮卡丘\n会提高攻击和特攻！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以我的皮卡丘是世界第一！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "643A5E264E8675356C147403768476AE53614E18000A4F1A63D09AD8653B51FB548C7279653BFF0100100001BE00000A62404EE56211768476AE53614E18662F4E16754C7B2C4E00FF0100100002011401690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你带着的皮卡丘\n要是比我的还强，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我就陪你打一场好了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E267740768476AE53614E18000A8981662F6BD4621176848FD85F3AFF0C00100001BE00000A62115C31966A4F6062534E00573A597D4E86FF0100100002011401690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皮卡丘1打1，\n准备好了就赶紧来找我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76AE53614E18003162530031FF0C000A51C65907597D4E865C318D767D276765627E6211FF0100100002011401690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这可是比拼谁的皮卡丘最强的对战！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要想挑战我的皮卡丘，\n你也必须只带1只皮卡丘。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD953EF662F6BD462FC8C01768476AE53614E1867005F3A76845BF96218FF0100100001BE01000A898160F3631162186211768476AE53614E18FF0C000A4F604E5F5FC5987B53EA5E26003153EA76AE53614E18300200100002011401690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来，你带的这只皮卡丘\n就是你最强的皮卡丘咯？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那我们来打一场，\n看看谁的皮卡丘才是世界第一吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B6765FF0C4F605E2676848FD953EA76AE53614E18000A5C31662F4F6067005F3A768476AE53614E1854AFFF1F00100001BE01000A90A362114EEC676562534E00573AFF0C000A770B770B8C01768476AE53614E18624D662F4E16754C7B2C4E005427FF1F00100002011401690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
